.TH KINTSUGI-DOCS 1 "2026-10-22" "kintsugi 0.8.0" "Kintsugi Manual"
.SH NAME
kintsugi-docs \- show man pages
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kintsugi docs
[<command>]
.br
.B kintsugi docs
list
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print a man page for a top-level command. Tries to render through the system
man(1) when available, falls back to plain text otherwise.
.SH COMMANDS
.IP \fB<command>\fR
Show the man page for a command
.IP \fBlist\fR
List available man pages
.SH EXAMPLES
View kintsugi-run man page:
.PP
  $ kintsugi docs run
.PP
List all man pages:
.PP
  $ kintsugi docs list
.PP
View overview:
.PP
  $ kintsugi docs
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kintsugi (1)
